  "contentHtml": "\n<main><section class=\"archive26-hero\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/red-carpet-02.webp\" alt=\"2026 연말 시상식 레드카펫의 NIGHT\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><div class=\"archive26-hero-shade\"></div><div class=\"archive26-hero-copy container\"><p class=\"archive26-kicker\">OFFICIAL EVENT PHOTO ARCHIVE</p><h1>YEAR-END<br>AWARDS<span>NIGHT · 2026</span></h1><div class=\"archive26-hero-meta\"><time datetime=\"2026-12-15\">2026.12.15</time><b>RED CARPET · CEREMONY · BACKSTAGE</b></div><a href=\"#red-carpet\">ENTER THE ARCHIVE ↓</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"archive26-intro section-tight\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"archive26-intro-grid\"><div><span class=\"section-kicker\">ONE WINTER NIGHT</span><h2>Twelve moments.</h2></div><p>레드카펫에서 시상식 무대와 소감 발표, 행사가 끝난 뒤의 백스테이지까지. 2026년 12월 15일 NIGHT의 연말 시상식 현장을 시간 순서로 기록합니다.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"archive26-chapter\" id=\"red-carpet\"><div class=\"container\"><header class=\"archive26-head\"><div><span>CHAPTER 01</span><h2>Red Carpet</h2></div><p>시상식의 시작을 알린 NIGHT 다섯 멤버의 공식 레드카펫 기록.</p></header><div class=\"archive26-grid\"><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/red-carpet-01.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · RED CARPET 01\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/red-carpet-01.webp\" alt=\"레드카펫에 선 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>NIGHT</b><small>RED CARPET 01</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/red-carpet-02.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · RED CARPET 02\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/red-carpet-02.webp\" alt=\"레드카펫 포토월의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>NIGHT</b><small>RED CARPET 02</small></span></button></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"archive26-chapter\"><div class=\"container\"><header class=\"archive26-head\"><div><span>CHAPTER 02</span><h2>Ceremony</h2></div><p>객석에서 수상자 발표와 시상, 소감까지 이어진 공식 행사 기록.</p></header><div class=\"archive26-grid\"><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/seated.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · SEATED\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/seated.webp\" alt=\"시상식 객석에 앉은 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>NIGHT</b><small>SEATED</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/winner-announcement.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · ANNOUNCEMENT\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/winner-announcement.webp\" alt=\"수상자 발표 순간의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>ANNOUNCEMENT</b><small>ON STAGE</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/award-presentation.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · PRESENTATION\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/award-presentation.webp\" alt=\"트로피를 받는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>AWARD PRESENTATION</b><small>ON STAGE</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/acceptance-speech.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · SPEECH\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/acceptance-speech.webp\" alt=\"수상 소감을 전하는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>ACCEPTANCE SPEECH</b><small>ON STAGE</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/group-photo.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · GROUP\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/group-photo.webp\" alt=\"시상식 공식 단체 사진의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>NIGHT</b><small>OFFICIAL GROUP</small></span></button></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"archive26-chapter\"><div class=\"container\"><header class=\"archive26-head\"><div><span>CHAPTER 03</span><h2>After the ceremony.</h2></div><p>백스테이지와 대기실, 포토월을 거쳐 퇴근길까지 이어진 마지막 다섯 장면.</p></header><div class=\"archive26-grid\"><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/backstage.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · BACKSTAGE\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/backstage.webp\" alt=\"시상식 백스테이지의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>BACKSTAGE</b><small>AFTER CEREMONY</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/backstage-walk.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · BACKSTAGE WALK\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/backstage-walk.webp\" alt=\"대기실로 돌아가는 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>BACKSTAGE WALK</b><small>AFTER CEREMONY</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/waiting-room.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · WAITING ROOM\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/waiting-room.webp\" alt=\"시상식 후 대기실의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>WAITING ROOM</b><small>AFTER CEREMONY</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/photo-wall.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · PHOTO WALL\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/photo-wall.webp\" alt=\"시상식 후 포토월의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>PHOTO WALL</b><small>AFTER CEREMONY</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo wide\" data-full=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/departure.webp\" data-title=\"2026 YEAR-END AWARDS · DEPARTURE\"><img src=\"assets/images/2026/year-end-awards/departure.webp\" alt=\"시상식 퇴근길의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>DEPARTURE</b><small>END OF THE NIGHT</small></span></button></div><div class=\"archive26-return\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"awards.html\">RETURN TO AWARDS</a><a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"after-hours.html\">VIEW AFTER HOURS</a></div></div></section></main>\n<div class=\"archive26-lightbox\" id=\"archive26Lightbox\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"2026 연말 시상식 이미지 크게 보기\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button class=\"archive26-close\" type=